      "explicit_ages": [],
      "identity_note": "\"Salamiel son of Salasadai\" matches Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai, the Simeonite chief of Num 1:6 (LXX Salamiel son of Sourisadai), and Judith is Simeonite (9:2); entity_index already lists Salamiel as an LXX alias of shelumiel. Mapped, but the generation count from the Mosaic era to Judith (14) is literary, not chronological."
    },
